label "Dual-process routing diagram"
box in 16 104 70 44 "input"
box router 120 96 110 60 "router|(difficulty)" acc
box fast 300 40 130 44 "fast path|direct answer"
box slow 300 160 130 44 "slow path|deliberate reasoning"
arrow in router
arrow router fast
arrow router slow
arrow slow fast dashed via=365,102
text 420 110 "distil" size=11 right
note "dashed = slow-path results distilled into the fast path over time"
